# Called by a *remote* engine node, from within its own ExecuteAction
# action callback, when its local execution needs to delegate to whichever
# engine currently handles a given Intent type (mirrors the Intent-yield
# step of the in-process EngineAdapter generator contract, but across a
# process boundary: the remote engine blocks on this call instead of
# yielding to a local Python generator). The Orchestrator performs the same
# resource/handoff bookkeeping as the in-process path
# (Orchestrator._delegate_intent) and returns the delegate's final Result.

string requesting_engine_id
string intent_type
string params_json
---
rammp_orchestrator_interfaces/Result result
